---
Wait until given subvolumes are completely removed from the filesystem

If no subvolume id is given, wait until all current deletion requests are
completed, but do not wait for subvolumes deleted in the meantime. The status of
subvolume ids is checked periodically.

Usage: sync [OPTIONS] <PATH> [SUBVOLIDS]...

Arguments:
  <PATH>
          Path to the btrfs filesystem mount point

  [SUBVOLIDS]...
          One or more subvolume IDs to wait for (waits for all pending if
          omitted)

Options:
  -s, --sleep <SECONDS>
          Sleep N seconds between checks (default: 1)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
